        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, inyas gooyeenyi, ‘sareenda NG'UTAMIIDA,’ aba gideaba nooyeenyi, “sareenda NG'UTAMIIDA,” nea ghayi ea neayeeshiineegwa, “Adiidu gooyeenyi, ‘sareenda NG'UTAMIIDA,’” ",
